# GoGoCash 1.1 — Product & Design System Rules

## What This Product Does

GoGoCash is a stablecoin cashback platform. Users shop at partner merchants and receive USDT/USDC cashback automatically. The core loop is: Browse Merchant → Activate Deal → Shop → Receive Cashback → Withdraw.

Business context:
- 220+ partner merchants
- Target: 500k users
- Cashback paid in USDT/USDC on BNB Chain, Polygon, Sonic, Celo
- Two user languages: English (`en`) and Thai (`th`)
- Primary market: Southeast Asia (Thailand first)

## Design System Source

**Figma:** https://www.figma.com/design/jFDx8MnbCtlCaTQxlhpJIp/GoGoCash-1.1?node-id=2-908

For EVERY screen you implement:
1. Open Figma, navigate to the exact frame
2. Use Inspect panel → extract exact padding, font-size, color hex → map to CSS variable below
3. Export icons as SVG → `public/icons/{name}.svg`
4. Export images as WebP → `public/images/`
5. Figma auto-layout → Tailwind `flex` or `grid`
6. Figma corner radius → `rounded-{n}`
7. Implement ALL states shown in Figma: default, hover, active, disabled, loading, empty, error

## CSS Variable Tokens

All visual values come from these tokens (defined in `src/app/globals.css`).
NEVER use hardcoded hex, rgb, or pixel values.

```css
/* Brand */
--primary-1       /* Main brand color */
--primary-2       /* Hover/active */
