```

## Core Component Rules

### MerchantCard
- Always show: merchant logo, name, cashback % badge (using `--cashback-green`), "Shop Now" CTA
- `isNew` prop: show "New" badge in top-right corner
- `isLoading` prop: show Skeleton layout, never flash empty content
- Click handler: navigate to `/[locale]/shop/[merchantId]`

### QuestCard
- Always show: quest title, progress bar (`<progress>` or div with width %), reward amount in USDT, expiry countdown
- Completed state: green checkmark overlay, "Claim Reward" CTA
- Expired state: greyed out, non-interactive

### OtpInput
- 6 digits, auto-advance on input, auto-backspace on delete
- Resend button: disabled for 60s countdown, then re-enabled
- **Port logic from `mygogocash/gogocash_app` `src/components/common/OtpInput.tsx` — restyle only**

### BottomSheet
- Slides up from bottom, 80% viewport height max
- Backdrop click = dismiss
- Drag handle at top
- Trap focus when open (accessibility)

### Skeleton
- Match exact shape/size of the real content it replaces
- Use `animate-pulse` (Tailwind)
- Never show Skeleton for > 10 seconds — show error state if data hasn't loaded

## Screen-Level Rules

### Home Feed
- Balance pill updates every 30s (TanStack Query `staleTime: 30000`)
- Banner carousel: auto-advance 5s, pause on user interaction
- "For You" section: show skeleton then load, never flash empty

### Shop / Merchant Directory
- Search: debounced 300ms, minimum 2 characters before API call
- Filter state persisted in URL query params (`?category=food&sort=cashback`)
- Infinite scroll: load next page when user is 200px from bottom

### Wallet
- Show USDT and USDC balances separately
- Pending cashback shown with clock icon, tooltip "Confirming transaction"
- Withdraw: validate amount >= minimum withdrawal (fetch from `/wallet/limits`)
- Multi-chain: use env vars for chain IDs and contract addresses

### Auth
- After login success: redirect to last visited protected page or `/[locale]/` home
- After register success: show confetti animation, then redirect to home
- OTP: 6 digits, 60s resend timer
- Phone: validate with `libphonenumber-js` before submission

## Analytics Events (Must Instrument)

Every user action must fire an analytics event via the analytics components ported from 1.0.

| Event | Trigger |
|---|---|
| `merchant_view` | User opens merchant storefront |
| `deal_activate` | User clicks "Activate Cashback" |
| `quest_start` | User starts a quest |
| `quest_complete` | User completes a quest |
| `withdraw_initiate` | User starts withdrawal |
| `withdraw_success` | Withdrawal confirmed on-chain |
| `referral_copy` | User copies referral link |
| `signup_complete` | Registration flow finished |

## i18n Rules

- Every user-visible string must use `useTranslations()` hook. No hardcoded English/Thai text in components.
- Translation key format: `featureName.componentName.key` (e.g., `shop.merchantCard.shopNow`)
- Add key to BOTH `src/messages/en.json` and `src/messages/th.json` in the same commit
- Date/number formatting: use `next-intl` formatters, not `Intl` directly

## Error Handling

- All API errors caught in TanStack Query `onError` → show `react-hot-toast` notification
- Critical errors (auth failure, wallet contract error) → full-page error boundary with retry
- Network offline: show persistent banner "You are offline. Some features may not work."
- Never show raw error messages to users — show friendly translated strings
